/**
\mainpage Sun Devil Rocketry Coding Style Guide

This page is intended to provide a guide to Sun Devil Rocketry's code styles
across all of our languages. For guidance on your specific language, please
see the specific page on the sidebar.

Every project, by default, uses this as its guidance. Overriding this guide
is at the discretion of the project lead, but no projects are known to do
this.

In general, our style is designed to emphasize readability via uniformity
and clear grouping of code blocks. Each language does this differently.

\subsection contact Contact

This guide is currently maintained by Eli Sells ([@etsells](https://github.com/etsells)).
*/